OL,3,GNEWSA'Extra money will not cure rough
OL,4,Asleeping', says former hostel worker
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Coventry hostel worker said
OL,7,Fmore money "will not cure underlying
OL,8,Fissues", after Prime Minister Andy
OL,9,FBurnham announced his #442 million plan
OL,10,Fto get rough sleepers off the streets
OL,11,Fby Christmas.
OL,13,FBurnham said on Tuesday that emergency
OL,14,Faccommodation will be provided to end
OL,15,Frough sleeping, alongside practical
OL,16,Fsupport for any health needs, as he did
OL,17,Fnot believe "anybody should be forced
OL,18,Fto sleep rough".
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
