OL,3,GNEWSA'Extra money will not cure rough
OL,4,Asleeping', says former hostel worker
OL,5,
OL,6,FNobby Clarke, who ran Coventry Winter
OL,7,FNight Shelter for seven years, told BBC
OL,8,FRadio CWR that rough sleepers need more
OL,9,Fsupport than "just being thrown a set
OL,10,Fof keys to an empty premise".
OL,12,FCoventry City Council said that its
OL,13,Frough sleepers team has more resources
OL,14,Fincluding mental health experts, and
OL,15,Fadditional funding will "allow us to
OL,16,Fenhance support".
